{
  "title": "Reproductive system and obstetrics",
  "note": "Female: hyster/o or metr/i (uterus), oophor/o (ovary), salping/o (uterine tube), colp/o or vagin/o, mamm/o or mast/o (breast), men/o (menstruation). Male: orchi/o, orchid/o or test/o (testis), prostat/o, sperm/o or spermat/o. Pregnancy and birth: gravid/o and -cyesis (pregnancy), par/o (bearing), nat/o (birth).",
  "src": { "t": "Medical Terminology 2e (Open RN), 7.2 Word Components Related to the Female Reproductive System", "u": "https://med.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/Medicine/Medical_Terminology_2e_(OpenRN)/07%3A_Female_Reproductive_System_Terminology/7.02%3A_Word_Components_Related_to_the_Female_Reproductive_System" },
  "items": [
